  "reason": "The strongest evidence (config_035: 0.725, config_036: 0.706) clearly identifies scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + multiprofile as the best encoder combination, with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion as the top-performing architecture. The only untested variant within this best encoder pair that retains the superior transformer aggregation is config_003 (transformer + concat). While weighted fusion has consistently outperformed concat in other settings (0.635 vs 0.629 for pca_n2000+avgpool), the interaction between transformer-based aggregation and concat fusion with the learned scvi_n200 representation has not been directly tested. This experiment completes the 2×2 aggregation×fusion matrix for the best encoders, reducing residual uncertainty about whether concat could interact favorably with transformer attention. With only 2 experiments remaining, confirming (or surprisingly beating) the current best of 0.725 within the most promising design region is the highest-value use of this slot, as it either solidifies our confidence in config_035 or reveals an overlooked combination."
